    "forensics": "Half of the recent losing cluster (Trades 3, 5, 6, and 8) were actually gross-profitable trades that turned into net losses due to premature breakeven stop triggers (at 0.85R) and failure to reach an overly ambitious 1.35% target before mid-day mean reversion or EOD square-off. Meanwhile, the full stop-loss hits on TATASTEEL and NTPC (Trades 1, 2, and 4) resulted from entering on moderate 2.4x volume sweeps during the 10:25\u201311:10 IST post-opening liquidity lull, where 0.60% stops were easily hunted by routine intraday noise.",
