    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #81 Post-Mortem & Parameter Mutation\nForensic analysis of Cycle #81 revealed significant fee drag (\u20b943.89 in fees against \u20b9-16.77 Net P&L) caused by premature breakeven stop-outs on gross-winning trades and mid-morning false breakouts in high-beta metals and PSU names. To convert scratch losses into realized wins and reduce whipsaw frequency, we are lowering `min_target_pct` from 1.35% to 1.15% to capture realistic intraday swings before afternoon decay, delaying `breakeven_trigger_r` from 0.85R to 1.10R to give developing trends breathing room, widening `min_sl_pct` from 0.60% to 0.68% to clear routine liquidity sweeps, and tightening entry selectivity by raising `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` from 2.40x to 2.65x."
